    "result_text": "Only `AcceptanceTest` exists, and the full build passes green.\n\nDone. The change satisfies the spec with minimal structural impact:\n\n**Two files touched:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` (readOnly string) property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains a `setSelfLink`/`getSelfLink`. No function changed here.\n\n2. **`RespondWithOwner.java`** \u2014 the GET `/api/owners/{ownerId}` responder, a single-method class (so `WMC_other = 0`), gained one line: `dto.setSelfLink(\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId());`, mirroring the adjacent `bulkSignupWarning` line.\n\nThe test creates an owner via `POST` and reads it back via `GET`, asserting `$.selfLink == \"/api/owners/\" + id` \u2014 now returned. Cost stays tiny: one line in a zero-context class, rather than editing the large MapStruct mapper (whose `WMC_other` would have made the same behavior far more expensive).",
